* ''The hands'': every hand opens a session. A tasked spirit comes down to an AI, a Mask and the vessel seat, attended or standing; the vessel seat serves as a spirit's system identity, carrying and witnessing while the act presents the worn face's proof; a Mask counts as no pet-name. The door carries and the hand authorizes, over one verb table, and a standing seat never signs an act that changes who holds authority (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/session-contract#/the-hands`>>).

